        "Description": "Four of the higher-ups within The Harmonium have been spotted in the slums of Mumbai. Our boots on the ground believe that they have infiltrated the infmaous gang known as The Crows as well as Vanya Shah&apos;s trainyard Queendom, and are using their influence on the poor people of Mumbai to bolster their own ranks.\r\rThe elimination of these four will significantly damage the organisation&apos;s regional activities, not to mention free innocent people from their schemes.\r\rEliminate the targets.",
